{"id":79,"name":"النازعات","transliteration":"An-Nazi'at","translation_fr":"Ceux qui arrachent","translation_en":"Those who drag forth","type":"meccan","total_verses":46,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَٰتِ غَرۡقٗا","translation_fr":"Par ceux qui arrachent violemment","translation_en":"By those [angels] who extract with violence","transliteration":"WaalnnaziAAati gharqan"},{"id":2,"text":"وَٱلنَّـٰشِطَٰتِ نَشۡطٗا","translation_fr":"Et par ceux qui recueillent avec douceur","translation_en":"And [by] those who remove with ease","transliteration":"Waalnnashitati nashtan"},{"id":3,"text":"وَٱلسَّـٰبِحَٰتِ سَبۡحٗا","translation_fr":"Et par ceux qui voguent librement","translation_en":"And [by] those who glide [as if] swimming","transliteration":"Waalssabihati sabhan"},{"id":4,"text":"فَٱلسَّـٰبِقَٰتِ سَبۡقٗا","translation_fr":"puis s'élancent à toute vitesse","translation_en":"And those who race each other in a race","transliteration":"Faalssabiqati sabqan"},{"id":5,"text":"فَٱلۡمُدَبِّرَٰتِ أَمۡرٗا","translation_fr":"et règlent les affaires","translation_en":"And those who arrange [each] matter","transliteration":"Faalmudabbirati amran"},{"id":6,"text":"يَوۡمَ تَرۡجُفُ ٱلرَّاجِفَةُ","translation_fr":"Le jour où [la terre] tremblera [au premier son du clairon]","translation_en":"On the Day the blast [of the Horn] will convulse [creation]","transliteration":"Yawma tarjufu alrrajifatu"},{"id":7,"text":"تَتۡبَعُهَا ٱلرَّادِفَةُ","translation_fr":"immédiatement suivi du deuxième","translation_en":"There will follow it the subsequent [one]","transliteration":"TatbaAAuha alrradifatu"},{"id":8,"text":"قُلُوبٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ وَاجِفَةٌ","translation_fr":"Ce jour-là, il y aura des cœurs qui seront agités d'effroi","translation_en":"Hearts, that Day, will tremble","transliteration":"Quloobun yawmaithin wajifatun"},{"id":9,"text":"أَبۡصَٰرُهَا خَٰشِعَةٞ","translation_fr":"et leurs regards se baisseront","translation_en":"Their eyes humbled","transliteration":"Absaruha khashiAAatun"},{"id":10,"text":"يَقُولُونَ أَءِنَّا لَمَرۡدُودُونَ فِي ٱلۡحَافِرَةِ","translation_fr":"Ils disent: «Quoi! Serons-nous ramenés à notre vie première","translation_en":"They are [presently] saying, \"Will we indeed be returned to [our] former state [of life]","transliteration":"Yaqooloona ainna lamardoodoona fee alhafirati"},{"id":11,"text":"أَءِذَا كُنَّا عِظَٰمٗا نَّخِرَةٗ","translation_fr":"quand nous serons ossements pourris?»","translation_en":"Even if we should be decayed bones","transliteration":"Aitha kunna AAithaman nakhiratan"},{"id":12,"text":"قَالُواْ تِلۡكَ إِذٗا كَرَّةٌ خَاسِرَةٞ","translation_fr":"Ils disent: «ce sera alors un retour ruineux!»","translation_en":"They say, \"That, then, would be a losing return","transliteration":"Qaloo tilka ithan karratun khasiratun"},{"id":13,"text":"فَإِنَّمَا هِيَ زَجۡرَةٞ وَٰحِدَةٞ","translation_fr":"Il n'y aura qu'une sommation","translation_en":"Indeed, it will be but one shout","transliteration":"Fainnama hiya zajratun wahidatun"},{"id":14,"text":"فَإِذَا هُم بِٱلسَّاهِرَةِ","translation_fr":"et voilà qu'ils seront sur la terre (ressuscités)","translation_en":"And suddenly they will be [alert] upon the earth's surface","transliteration":"Faitha hum bialssahirati"},{"id":15,"text":"هَلۡ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ مُوسَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Le récit de Moïse t'est-il parvenu","translation_en":"Has there reached you the story of Moses","transliteration":"Hal ataka hadeethu moosa"},{"id":16,"text":"إِذۡ نَادَىٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ بِٱلۡوَادِ ٱلۡمُقَدَّسِ طُوًى","translation_fr":"Quand son Seigneur l'appela, dans Towâ, la vallée sanctifiée","translation_en":"When his Lord called to him in the sacred valley of Tuwa","transliteration":"Ith nadahu rabbuhu bialwadi almuqaddasi tuwan"},{"id":17,"text":"ٱذۡهَبۡ إِلَىٰ فِرۡعَوۡنَ إِنَّهُۥ طَغَىٰ","translation_fr":"«Va vers Pharaon. Vraiment, il s'est rebellé!»","translation_en":"Go to Pharaoh. Indeed, he has transgressed","transliteration":"Ithhab ila firAAawna innahu tagha"},{"id":18,"text":"فَقُلۡ هَل لَّكَ إِلَىٰٓ أَن تَزَكَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Puis dis-lui: «Voudrais-tu te purifier","translation_en":"And say to him, 'Would you [be willing to] purify yourself","transliteration":"Faqul hal laka ila an tazakka"},{"id":19,"text":"وَأَهۡدِيَكَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَتَخۡشَىٰ","translation_fr":"et que je te guide vers ton Seigneur afin que tu Le craignes?»","translation_en":"And let me guide you to your Lord so you would fear [Him]","transliteration":"Waahdiyaka ila rabbika fatakhsha"},{"id":20,"text":"فَأَرَىٰهُ ٱلۡأٓيَةَ ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"Il lui fit voir le très grand miracle","translation_en":"And he showed him the greatest sign","transliteration":"Faarahu alayata alkubra"},{"id":21,"text":"فَكَذَّبَ وَعَصَىٰ","translation_fr":"Mais il le qualifia de mensonge et désobéit","translation_en":"But Pharaoh denied and disobeyed","transliteration":"Fakaththaba waAAasa"},{"id":22,"text":"ثُمَّ أَدۡبَرَ يَسۡعَىٰ","translation_fr":"Ensuite, il tourna le dos, s'en alla précipitamment","translation_en":"Then he turned his back, striving","transliteration":"Thumma adbara yasAAa"},{"id":23,"text":"فَحَشَرَ فَنَادَىٰ","translation_fr":"rassembla [les gens] et leur fit une proclamation","translation_en":"And he gathered [his people] and called out","transliteration":"Fahashara fanada"},{"id":24,"text":"فَقَالَ أَنَا۠ رَبُّكُمُ ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰ","translation_fr":"et dit: «C'est moi votre Seigneur, le très haut»","translation_en":"And said, \"I am your most exalted lord","transliteration":"Faqala ana rabbukumu alaAAla"},{"id":25,"text":"فَأَخَذَهُ ٱللَّهُ نَكَالَ ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ وَٱلۡأُولَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Alors Allah le saisit de la punition exemplaire de l'au-delà et de celle d'ici-bas","translation_en":"So Allah seized him in exemplary punishment for the last and the first [transgression]","transliteration":"Faakhathahu Allahu nakala alakhirati waaloola"},{"id":26,"text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَعِبۡرَةٗ لِّمَن يَخۡشَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Il y a certes là un sujet de réflexion pour celui qui craint","translation_en":"Indeed in that is a warning for whoever would fear [Allah]","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika laAAibratan liman yakhsha"},{"id":27,"text":"ءَأَنتُمۡ أَشَدُّ خَلۡقًا أَمِ ٱلسَّمَآءُۚ بَنَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Etes-vous plus durs à créer? ou le ciel, qu'Il a pourtant construit","translation_en":"Are you a more difficult creation or is the heaven? Allah constructed it","transliteration":"Aantum ashaddu khalqan ami alssamao banaha"},{"id":28,"text":"رَفَعَ سَمۡكَهَا فَسَوَّىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Il a élevé bien haut sa voûte, puis l'a parfaitement ordonné","translation_en":"He raised its ceiling and proportioned it","transliteration":"RafaAAa samkaha fasawwaha"},{"id":29,"text":"وَأَغۡطَشَ لَيۡلَهَا وَأَخۡرَجَ ضُحَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Il a assombri sa nuit et fait luire son jour","translation_en":"And He darkened its night and extracted its brightness","transliteration":"Waaghtasha laylaha waakhraja duhaha"},{"id":30,"text":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ بَعۡدَ ذَٰلِكَ دَحَىٰهَآ","translation_fr":"Et quant à la terre, après cela, Il l'a étendue","translation_en":"And after that He spread the earth","transliteration":"Waalarda baAAda thalika dahaha"},{"id":31,"text":"أَخۡرَجَ مِنۡهَا مَآءَهَا وَمَرۡعَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Il a fait sortir d'elle son eau et son pâturage","translation_en":"He extracted from it its water and its pasture","transliteration":"Akhraja minha maaha wamarAAaha"},{"id":32,"text":"وَٱلۡجِبَالَ أَرۡسَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"et quant aux montagnes, Il les a ancrées","translation_en":"And the mountains He set firmly","transliteration":"Waaljibala arsaha"},{"id":33,"text":"مَتَٰعٗا لَّكُمۡ وَلِأَنۡعَٰمِكُمۡ","translation_fr":"pour votre jouissance, vous et vos bestiaux","translation_en":"As provision for you and your grazing livestock","transliteration":"MataAAan lakum walianAAamikum"},{"id":34,"text":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلطَّآمَّةُ ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"Puis quand viendra le grand cataclysme","translation_en":"But when there comes the greatest Overwhelming Calamity","transliteration":"Faitha jaati alttammatu alkubra"},{"id":35,"text":"يَوۡمَ يَتَذَكَّرُ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ مَا سَعَىٰ","translation_fr":"le jour où l'homme se rappellera à quoi il s'est efforcé","translation_en":"The Day when man will remember that for which he strove","transliteration":"Yawma yatathakkaru alinsanu ma saAAa"},{"id":36,"text":"وَبُرِّزَتِ ٱلۡجَحِيمُ لِمَن يَرَىٰ","translation_fr":"l'Enfer sera pleinement visible à celui qui regardera","translation_en":"And Hellfire will be exposed for [all] those who see","transliteration":"Waburrizati aljaheemu liman yara"},{"id":37,"text":"فَأَمَّا مَن طَغَىٰ","translation_fr":"Quant à celui qui aura dépassé les limites","translation_en":"So as for he who transgressed","transliteration":"Faamma man tagha"},{"id":38,"text":"وَءَاثَرَ ٱلۡحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنۡيَا","translation_fr":"et aura préféré la vie présente","translation_en":"And preferred the life of the world","transliteration":"Waathara alhayata alddunya"},{"id":39,"text":"فَإِنَّ ٱلۡجَحِيمَ هِيَ ٱلۡمَأۡوَىٰ","translation_fr":"alors, l'Enfer sera son refuge","translation_en":"Then indeed, Hellfire will be [his] refuge","transliteration":"Fainna aljaheema hiya almawa"},{"id":40,"text":"وَأَمَّا مَنۡ خَافَ مَقَامَ رَبِّهِۦ وَنَهَى ٱلنَّفۡسَ عَنِ ٱلۡهَوَىٰ","translation_fr":"Et pour celui qui aura redouté de comparaître devant son Seigneur, et préservé son âme de la passion","translation_en":"But as for he who feared the position of his Lord and prevented the soul from [unlawful] inclination","transliteration":"Waama man khafa maqama rabbihi wanaha alnnafsa AAani alhawa"},{"id":41,"text":"فَإِنَّ ٱلۡجَنَّةَ هِيَ ٱلۡمَأۡوَىٰ","translation_fr":"le Paradis sera alors son refuge","translation_en":"Then indeed, Paradise will be [his] refuge","transliteration":"Fainna aljannata hiya almawa"},{"id":42,"text":"يَسۡـَٔلُونَكَ عَنِ ٱلسَّاعَةِ أَيَّانَ مُرۡسَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Ils t'interrogent au sujet de l'Heure: «Quand va-t-elle jeter l'ancre?»","translation_en":"They ask you, [O Muhammad], about the Hour: when is its arrival","transliteration":"Yasaloonaka AAani alssaAAati ayyana mursaha"},{"id":43,"text":"فِيمَ أَنتَ مِن ذِكۡرَىٰهَآ","translation_fr":"Quelle [science] en as-tu pour le leur dire","translation_en":"In what [position] are you that you should mention it","transliteration":"Feema anta min thikraha"},{"id":44,"text":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ مُنتَهَىٰهَآ","translation_fr":"Son terme n'est connu que de ton Seigneur","translation_en":"To your Lord is its finality","transliteration":"Ila rabbika muntahaha"},{"id":45,"text":"إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُنذِرُ مَن يَخۡشَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Tu n'es que l'avertisseur de celui qui la redoute","translation_en":"You are only a warner for those who fear it","transliteration":"Innama anta munthiru man yakhshaha"},{"id":46,"text":"كَأَنَّهُمۡ يَوۡمَ يَرَوۡنَهَا لَمۡ يَلۡبَثُوٓاْ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوۡ ضُحَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Le jour où ils la verront, il leur semblera n'avoir demeuré qu'un soir ou un matin","translation_en":"It will be, on the Day they see it, as though they had not remained [in the world] except for an afternoon or a morning thereof","transliteration":"Kaannahum yawma yarawnaha lam yalbathoo illa AAashiyyatan aw duhaha"}]}